OL,3,GNEWSAGive our southern villages tourism
OL,4,Aboost, say families
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat loss, along with the rising cost
OL,7,Fof living, is something of much concern
OL,8,Fto traders, including Port Erin gift
OL,9,Fshop owner Dawn Sim, who said people
OL,10,Fwere "just not coming out".
